Errors Fixed: Unsupported field value: undefined
Root Cause
Firestore's setDoc() method strictly prohibits undefined values for any field in a document. When creating contributions (especially batch contributions or cash payments), optional fields such as transactionRef, notes, or datePaid were passed as undefined (e.g. transactionRef: transactionRef.trim() || undefined). This triggered:
Code
FirebaseError: Function setDoc() called with invalid data. Unsupported field value: undefined (found in field transactionRef in document contributions/CON-...)
