Added Recursive sanitizeForFirestore Helper (src/firebase.ts & server.ts):
Strips any keys with undefined values from data objects before invoking setDoc().
Applied automatically across all write functions: saveContributionToFirestore, saveMemberToFirestore, saveFamilyToFirestore, saveSettingsToFirestore, and safeFirestoreSetDoc.
Cleaned Default Form Values (src/components/RecordPaymentModal.tsx):
Replaced || undefined fallbacks with safe empty strings ('') for transactionRef, notes, and datePaid.
